@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
actor "Hardware / Simulatore" as HW
participant "Local MQTT\nBroker" as LocalMQTT
participant "BitPub Edge\nNode" as Edge
database "Edge DB\n(SQLite)" as Buffer
participant "API Gateway\n(Cloud)" as Gateway
participant "Match Service\n(Cloud)" as Match
participant "Notification Service\n(Cloud)" as Notify
participant "React WebApp\n(Client WS)" as WebApp

HW -> LocalMQTT: Publish su `bitpub/match/{id}/event` (es. Goal)
LocalMQTT -> Edge: Edge consuma l'evento
Edge -> Edge: Valida Payload e id evento (Idempotency)
Edge -> Buffer: Salva temporaneamente (Buffer offline)

Edge -> Gateway: POST /api/matches/{id}/events
Gateway -> Match: Inoltra Evento REST
Match -> Match: Elabora Evento (State Machine Calciobalilla/Freccette)
Match -> Match: Aggiorna Punteggio DB e stato partita

alt Partita Terminata
    Match -> Match: Chiudi Match (Status = FINISHED)
    Match -> "Statistics Service": Aggiorna Leaderboard (Asincrono)
end

Match -> Notify: Invia MatchStateUpdateEvent (Cloud Internal)
Notify -> WebApp: Push via WebSocket (Stato aggiornato)
WebApp -> WebApp: Renderizza animazione e nuovo punteggio

Match --> Gateway: 201 Created (Ack)
Gateway --> Edge: 201 Created
Edge -> Buffer: Rimuovi evento dal buffer (Sincronizzato)
@enduml
